#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:491
msgid "Further information on processing operations, procedures and services:"
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: cookie name, 2: number of days.
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:500
#, php-format
msgid "Meal planner: for visitors who are not logged in, a cookie named “%1$s” stores a random, pseudonymous identifier that links the recipe selection to the browser; the selection itself is stored on the server and deleted automatically after %2$d day."
msgid_plural "Meal planner: for visitors who are not logged in, a cookie named “%1$s” stores a random, pseudonymous identifier that links the recipe selection to the browser; the selection itself is stored on the server and deleted automatically after %2$d days."
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#. translators: %d: number of days.
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:512
#, php-format
msgid "Sharing the planner: using the share button deliberately creates a copy of the recipe selection. It is stored on the server under a random identifier of its own, can be opened by anyone holding the generated link, and is deleted automatically after %d day. The copy is frozen: later changes to one's own planner do not appear in it, and the link gives no access to the planner itself. Only recipe IDs, servings, meal type and weekday are stored — no identifier of the person sharing. No copy exists unless someone shares."
msgid_plural "Sharing the planner: using the share button deliberately creates a copy of the recipe selection. It is stored on the server under a random identifier of its own, can be opened by anyone holding the generated link, and is deleted automatically after %d days. The copy is frozen: later changes to one's own planner do not appear in it, and the link gives no access to the planner itself. Only recipe IDs, servings, meal type and weekday are stored — no identifier of the person sharing. No copy exists unless someone shares."
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:531
msgid "Saving plans: a plan saved in the planner becomes a publicly accessible page showing its recipes, servings and weekdays."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:534
msgid "Plans saved by visitors who are not logged in are first stored as drafts and only appear publicly once we publish them; no name is stored with them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:535
msgid "Visitors who are not logged in can save plans too; no name is stored with them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:537
msgid "For logged-in users, the display name of their account is shown as the author."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %d: number of days.
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:542
#, php-format
msgid "Plans we do not assign to a category are deleted automatically %d day after they were saved."
msgid_plural "Plans we do not assign to a category are deleted automatically %d days after they were saved."
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:553
msgid "Saved plans are kept until their deletion is requested."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:564
msgid "Abuse protection: when a visitor saves a meal plan or downloads a plan as a PDF, the IP address is stored in hashed (pseudonymised) form as a short-lived counter — about a minute for PDFs, an hour when saving — and then deleted automatically."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:565
msgid "PDF export: to limit abuse, the IP address is stored in hashed (pseudonymised) form as a short-lived counter when a plan PDF is downloaded, and deleted automatically after about a minute."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:575
msgid "Recipe ratings: logged-in users and e-mail subscribers (via a personalised link) can leave star ratings and reviews. These are published as a comment with the name given and stored together with the e-mail address, until the author objects or requests deletion. Ratings via the subscriber link appear immediately and are stored without an IP address."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:576
msgid "Recipe ratings: logged-in users can leave star ratings and reviews. These are published as a comment with the name given and stored together with the e-mail address, until the author objects or requests deletion."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:577
msgid "Ratings submitted through the comment form are processed by WordPress's comment function, which also stores the IP address and the browser identification (user agent)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:580
msgid "Photos appear publicly without prior review."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:581
msgid "Photos are reviewed editorially before they appear publicly."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:584
msgid "Meal photos: logged-in users and subscribers (via a personalised link) can upload photos of dishes they cooked. The photo and the display name given are stored; embedded metadata of the image file (EXIF, including GPS location data) is removed automatically on upload."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:585
msgid "Meal photos: logged-in users can upload photos of dishes they cooked. The photo and the display name given are stored; embedded metadata of the image file (EXIF, including GPS location data) is removed automatically on upload."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:587
msgid "They are kept until consent is withdrawn or deletion is requested."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:592
msgid "E-mail subscriptions: sign-ups use the double opt-in procedure, either on the page of a meal plan or when saving a plan in the planner."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:593
msgid "E-mail subscriptions: sign-ups use the double opt-in procedure, on the page of a meal plan."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:599
msgid "The e-mails contain the meals and the shopping list of the subscribed plan, links for rating its recipes and sharing photos, and a short additional text from us."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:600
msgid "The e-mails contain the meals and the shopping list of the subscribed plan and links for rating its recipes and sharing photos."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: confirmation window, e.g. "48 hours".
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:607
#, php-format
msgid "Providing an e-mail address is required to save a plan in the planner; without it the plan cannot be saved. If the sign-up is not confirmed, the plan stays saved, the address is deleted after %s and no further e-mails are sent."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %d: number of hours.
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:609
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:628
#, php-format
msgid "%d hour"
msgid_plural "%d hours"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:612
msgid "Giving an e-mail address when saving a plan is voluntary; the plan is saved without it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:615
msgid "Stored are the e-mail address, optionally a name, the subscribed meal plan, the times of sign-up and confirmation, and an access token that the links in the e-mails rely on. To limit abuse, the IP address is additionally stored in hashed form for at most one hour when signing up on a plan's page."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:618
msgid "As proof of consent, the full IP address used to sign up is also stored with the subscription record and deleted with it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:619
msgid "No IP address is stored as proof of consent."
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: number of hours, 2: number of days.
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:626
#, php-format
msgid "Deletion: unconfirmed sign-ups are deleted automatically after %1$s. A running subscription is kept while it runs; finished or cancelled subscriptions are deleted %2$s after they ended and are kept until then as proof of consent (Art. 7(1), Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR)."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %d: number of days.
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:630
