#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:635
msgid "Suppression list: unsubscribed e-mail addresses are kept in an internal suppression list so that the objection is honoured permanently (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR in conjunction with Art. 21(3) GDPR)."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %d: number of entries.
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:645
#, php-format
msgid "Send log: to trace delivery problems and prove delivery, a limited log of sent e-mails is kept. It records metadata only — recipient address, subject, delivery status and time — never the content of the messages. The log is limited to the %d most recent entries; older ones are dropped automatically."
